  "description": "BEPKEN crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P b c n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C184 H232 Gd8 O72 S16,8(C2 H6 O1),4(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd4C (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd1C (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd3C (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2C (Gd) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 8 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.683-4.012 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.07-113.49°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C200H288Gd8O84S16. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 4 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
